      "title": "Time per Schedule",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Per scheduling round: the soft and hard budgets it was granted, the deadline it was actually given (start plus the soft limit, clamped by the hard limit from the poll wakeup), and how long it ran. All four are normalised to seconds — `Real` comes from a counter the exporter already converts, the other three are raw microseconds divided by the round count."
